# Patches are hash-pinned or applied verbatim: check them out byte-exact on every OS, never with
# core.autocrlf's CRLF conversion. Plain -text (not `binary`) keeps their diffs reviewable.
*.patch -text
# Generated skill assets are compared byte-for-byte and hashed into .baseline.json; keep them LF on every OS.
assets/skills/frink-flows/** text eol=lf
